      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样的她也有一位可以称为挚友的人。\n她和午子正好相反，个性开朗又受欢迎，\n将来也备受期待……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b1c44bc5045609599a3c8cc027c0cc12c32b6081fd430723d056bee49f1304c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
