      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在引退时告诉午子……\n“接下来要带着我的梦想一起奔跑喔”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9105dd31c9b98ab7554225761b0ce956881683b6ca9bb20a555a90a91eafcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
