      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔……呜呜……呜……这一幕在书里也是\n少有的名场面，一想起来就忍不住流泪……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "879566d2ad16f7729b1cda09a79dd3617fa2cd229bfb916c8fc7315df4a7ccb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
